aguchi.haruyo/2023-04-05/49820_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1459.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>学校<rt>がっこう</rt></ruby>でも<ruby>撮影<rt>さつえい</rt></ruby>しました～</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">これは<ruby>屋上<rt>おくじょう</rt></ruby>です</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>学生<rt>がくせい</rt></ruby>のときの<ruby>屋上<rt>おくじょう</rt></ruby>は<ruby>憧<rt>あこが</rt></ruby>れですよね</span><span class=\"s3\">🥰</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2023-04-05/49820_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1464.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>制服<rt>せいふく</rt></ruby>に<ruby>髪の毛<rt>かみのけ</rt></ruby><ruby>巻<rt>ま</rt></ruby>いたの<ruby>初<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>めて</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px; -webkit-text-size-ad